  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Reading this view",
      "items": [
        "snake_case labels are real session.phase strings. 'established + granted' is phase 'established' with session.granted = True (carrier.py 856). Nodes tagged conceptual or 'phase group' are not phase strings.",
        "Pilot pattern calls advance only with a radar track and range checks (_pattern 1222-1252). touchdown and on_deck come from mission telemetry, and on_deck is debounced (overlord_carrier.lua 563-576)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Marshal and lane",
      "items": [
        "CASE I holds overhead at angels 2-9. CASE II/III marshal on the reciprocal of the final bearing at angels 6-13, DME = angels + 15 (92-96, 752-774).",
        "One deck/approach lane per ship: emergency first, then enrolment order (729-731). The grant needs no foul deck and one of CASE I, priority, or expected approach time reached (863-867).",
        "In CASE I, 'initial' may follow established + granted directly, without commencing (PATTERN 110-118)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Other recovery views",
      "items": [
        "CASE I/II/III pattern variants",
        "Bolter, wave-off and foul deck recycle",
        "Reassignment, stale bridge, closure and departure handover"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Transition evidence (file lines)",
      "items": [
        "assignment: facts present, angels free: facts present, free angels (752-774, 845-848)",
        "full readback, in order: every field, in order (1189-1197, 355-372)",
        "telemetry: at fix, \u00b11000 ft: telemetry: at fix, within 1000 ft (1205-1218)",
        "lane: no foul deck; CASE I, priority or EAT: no foul deck; CASE I, priority or EAT (849-867)",
        "pilot call + range (optional in CASE I): pilot call + range (1222-1252)",
        "pilot call, \u22648 nm: CASE I/II (110-118)",
        "pilot call, \u22645 nm: 1263-1264",
        "abeam, \u22645 nm: 1266-1267",
        "ball: range, height, astern, deck not foul: sector check, deck not foul (1238-1247)",
        "telemetry: land on this ship: telemetry carrier_id matches (623-630)",
        "telemetry: on_deck (3 s stopped): mission debounce (652-656)",
        "pilot: deck clear: pilot call releases lane (1300-1304)"
      ]
    }
  ]
